{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1793818139630957002,"compiled_state":{"alias":"carbonous-bipartisan-ammonite","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"24d2c8763e2135fec9393154acd06b4c68389f3b1f22d4c68f0c5fc1d1d9d8cf","event_uuid":"b9184801-c886-478a-99a6-9600ae1e1a10","position":{"commit_sha":"baea26fa47d5188ae11fb7587fb1e4d379c495ad","position":"1793818055831750001-b9184801-c886-478a-99a6-9600ae1e1a10"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"},{"content_hash":"64064a4e3d814777a2d07231b101e71090e3f4ef34ed322b42da39b8bc61f372","event_uuid":"d1fef0c6-3af8-4a11-bb07-52aeceb786fd","position":{"commit_sha":"a1253e838b27c0fac0232ae2067e11c2a4e62281","position":"1793818139630957001-d1fef0c6-3af8-4a11-bb07-52aeceb786fd"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1793818055831750001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"d1fef0c6-3af8-4a11-bb07-52aeceb786fd","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"40c3-d22a-3872-4c8c"}],"description":"## Observation\nWhen `REBAR_ROOT` is unset, every library read rediscovers the code repo root with `git rev-parse --show-toplevel`, through `repo_root` (`src/rebar/_config_sources.py:53`), which `config.tracker_dir` and `config.load_config` call on each read. Measured on a throwaway two-repo store with the freshness marker fresh, after the synonymous-destined-cricket fix:\n\n- `rebar.show_ticket`: 5 git spawns. 2 come from `_reads._tracker` → `config.tracker_dir` (one direct, one via `load_config`), 2 from the same path in the cross-session warning's own read, and 1 from `cross_session.cross_session_warning_for` → `load_config`.\n- `rebar.list_tickets`: 2 git spawns (`tracker_dir` and `load_config`).\n\nWith `REBAR_ROOT` set, or an explicit `repo_root` (as `rebar audit serve` passes), the same reads spawn 0. The root of a process's cwd does not change between reads in one process, so these are repeated lookups of the same answer.\n\nDiscovered while fixing synonymous-destined-cricket (40c3-d22a-3872-4c8c), whose scope is the freshness throttle only.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A library `show_ticket` with `REBAR_ROOT` unset, run from inside a git work tree, starts at most 1 `rev-parse --show-toplevel`, shown by a git-spawn-count test.\n- [ ] A cwd change between reads still resolves the new cwd's repo root, shown by a test.","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"46ec-e50d-49f6-4774","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Library reads rediscover the repo root with git on every call when REBAR_ROOT is unset","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["b9184801-c886-478a-99a6-9600ae1e1a10","d1fef0c6-3af8-4a11-bb07-52aeceb786fd"]},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1793818139630957002,"uuid":"ef6951aa-3e02-4ae4-8c76-7830c4737ea4"}